Re-import procedure: https://github.com/kurone-kito/dotfiles/blob/master/docs/idd-user-global-reimport.md

In this setup `idd-activation` is deployed to `~/.local/bin`. If it is not on `PATH`,
run `~/.local/bin/idd-activation` instead, or `~/.local/bin/idd-activation.cmd` on
Windows. The `node` fallback in the entry text does not work here, because the
payload has no `scripts/` directory.

